s.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/84107b5781aefa065bd26aab5313fedfcc7bf4475a064772ac75346c7d836b32.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/982ddb59bd5a6283522c5b0d9bab6a0b3e31718c1652fa62c5bb9e7eccfca4c2.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野村 勝人","creatorId":"vndb:s2224","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2224","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2224","name":"野村 勝人","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:30263","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c3736","characterName":"クオン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c3736"},"originalCharacterName":"クオン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Irina's personal maid."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3736"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c807680c200f992799a86405900632c4c23310f410ceaf2641e7ea9359cdd90.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b382e33d79837a84c76f458480db377f6f92d0af273609d97e0f65b9e95d4041.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"韮井 叶","creatorId":"vndb:s1182","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1182","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1182","name":"韮井叶","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:30262","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c752","characterName":"イリーナ・ウラジーミロヴナ・プチナ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c752"},"originalCharacterName":"イリーナ・ウラジーミロヴナ・プチナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1007"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"It's best if you don't anger me too much...\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An active duty president who reigns over Rusia with super charisma. She obtains information that a UFO crashed into Nippon, and visits to talk about laws dealing with import restrictions. On the day of her visit, she is saved by the protagonist and falls in love at first sight. She becomes interested in him ever since, making an appearance at his school as a transfer student while handling government affairs. However, she becomes disillusioned by the protagonist, the great king of sexual harassment. She disciplines him with her slapping fan to make him into a gentleman even to this day. As a disciplinarian in school, correcting the behavior of the students is her daily routine. She fosters a rivalry against the childhood friend president who's also the head of the student council, and seems to have plans to correct the entire school as a disciplinarian. Yukino and her friends nicknamed her Puchin, but she gets mad when they call her that."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From JAST USA's official site"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is the local superhero of Ota Ward in Naka no Hito nado Inai! Tokyo Hero Project."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c752"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a00ccf21d6966022f2a4beff7a085671e74d5b095aef79882fc8a8fbdcfbb03b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d3251ff24709c8bbec0401567120849e4b6179e7eb47aa881b0236f6a7b54428.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"海原 エレナ","creatorId":"vndb:s125","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s125","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s125","name":"海原エレナ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:30256","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c753","characterName":"航宙船ヱゼキエル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c753"},"originalCharacterName":"航宙船ヱゼキエル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"309"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"145"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Please teach me how to love.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A state-of-the-art UFO that crashed into Nippon and becomes humanoid by using a transforming ability. Her identity is made top secret, and she protects the president and her cabinet as an SP agent in government. Although she is a UFO, she appears to have a fear of heights. Quiet and shy of strangers. A girl that leaves a fleeting impression in some respects. She has an earnest and obedient personality, and can be a natural airhead that takes jokes seriously and does hysterical things. She chooses to get close to Junichiro and take care of him in order to understand the love that's awakening inside of her. Due to having limited knowledge pertaining to sex, she obediently receives Junichiro's sexual harassment."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From JAST USA's official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c753"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/554fb0727d8858847d5b56b2258b79d5db66ffe149d0a9e0fc3678e96a6c57ef.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8c2794b31f58038d83251bc31c06f871a2bc9c8a9c1b0d327928cd0d73c378da.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"みる","creatorId":"vndb:s364","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s364","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s364","name":"壱智村 小真","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:30258","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c754","characterName":"三芳 蘭","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c754"},"originalCharacterName":"三芳 蘭","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"517"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Onee-san doesn't remember raising you to be that way!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A childhood friend of the protagonist who lives near his house, and is one year older. Whenever she has time off, she often comes over to look after the protagonist or Yukino, whose parents are seldom at home. A mysterious woman with an obscure private life. She is an upperclassman at school, and Kuon's classmate. A busy person that works part time at a Chinese restaurant while serving as Yukino's Chief of Staff. She is the former student council president, currently undertaking the role of student council advisor. The winner of last year's school beauty pageant. Provides various intelligence by making use of her wide connections. Serves as Chief of Staff in government. Noted as the person that recommended Yukino to become president (student council president in the real world). She mostly takes care of domestic affairs, and the president and internal staff depend on her. She gives instructions to the staff while serving them her delicious Chinese cuisine."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From JAST USA's official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c754"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e61daa8171cf769a623212dfe0535ba48e44184dbcd3e59d4067c359f42f0d27.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/64/64ca516e8540d36c9c9ff88695a4dce807e494375124bcdcfbe4760e913e10ee.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柏 さくら","creatorId":"vndb:s469","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s469","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s469","name":"後藤 麻衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:30260","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c755","characterName":"本堂 純一郎","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c755"},"originalCharacterName":"本堂 純一郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"This happens all the time in Hollywood.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of the story. To support his childhood friend who became the president, he becomes the vice president. For some reason, he remembers the original world before his childhood friend became president. He has a memory that exceeds an ordinary person's, and an excessively tough body. His personality is that of a sociable, bright, and unabashed pervert with an honest heart. He likes girls and often gets beat up for his sexual harassment. Contrary to his usual playful attitude, he has a strong sense of justice and responsibility, acting with the belief of \"I can do it!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From JAST USA's official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c755"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"http